<h1>Password Reset Request</h1>

<p>Hi <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>

<p>
  We received a request to reset your EpiLink account password. Use the
  one-time code below to continue. This code expires in
  <strong>{{expiryMinutes}} minutes</strong>.
</p>

<div style="text-align:center;margin:32px 0;">
  <div style="
    display:inline-block;
    padding:18px 40px;
    background:#1b4f72;
    border-radius:8px;
    font-size:36px;
    font-weight:800;
    letter-spacing:10px;
    color:#ffffff;
    font-family:monospace;
  ">{{otp}}</div>
</div>

<div class="warning-box">
  <p>
    <strong>Never share this code with anyone.</strong>
    EpiLink staff will never ask for your OTP. If you did not request a
    password reset, you can safely ignore this email — your account remains
    secure.
  </p>
</div>

<p>
  The code will expire automatically after {{expiryMinutes}} minutes for
  your security.
</p>
